python3-pyfasm64 (0.1.8-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 0.1.8.
  * Added native Windows taskbar system tray background application engine (zero visible desktop window).
  * Added UTF-16 Unicode wide string support (du) and Win32 Wide APIs (CreateWindowExW, SetWindowTextW) eliminating all mojibake.
  * Added Windows 10/11 immersive dark mode (DWMWA_USE_IMMERSIVE_DARK_MODE) and dark GDI control theme.
  * Added rich master-detail split-view support for search and catalog desktop applications.

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 08:05:00 -0500

python3-pyfasm64 (0.1.5-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 0.1.5.
  * Fixed boolean literals (True/False/None) codegen to emit 1/0 instead of unresolved symbol.
  * Added x86 CPU mnemonics (str, wait, lock, pause) and FASM operators to reserved keywords.
  * Added automated GitHub Camo badge cache purge on release.

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 05:50:00 -0500

python3-pyfasm64 (0.1.4-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 0.1.4.
  * Escaped identifiers with leading digits and FASM reserved keywords.
  * Added fallback stubs for unresolved Python symbols.
  * Dual wheel packaging containing both pyfasm and pyfasm64.
  * Switched build backend to hatchling.

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 04:45:00 -0500

python3-pyfasm64 (0.1.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 0.1.1 on PyPI as pyfasm64.
  * Added pyfasm64 and pyfasm entry points and aliases for 100% backward compatibility.
  * Full support for CPython 3.8-3.16, Free-Threaded No-GIL (3.13t-3.16t), and PyPy.
  * Preserved full compatibility with python3-pyfasm package via Provides/Replaces.

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 08:00:00 -0500

